<Paragraph Type="Scene Heading"><SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="1" Title=""/><Text>EXT. MARKET - DAY</Text></Paragraph>
<Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>Beat 1. Vendors shout over each other as RAVI pushes through the crowd, a sack of rice on his shoulder, counting the stalls under his breath while the monsoon clouds gather overhead.</Text></Paragraph>
